(;FF[4]CA[UTF-8]GM[1]SZ[19]GN[Created by 5-dan Yin Hang. Commentary: I created this problem based on the shape of the letter "I" in "SPRING". It was totally beyond my expectation that this shape actually appeared in a real game - in the 2008 National Individual Weiqi Tournament, this shape emerged during the match between Cui Can and Zhang Dongyue. Cui Can had done this problem before and knew the inner group was dead, so he used the variations inside as ko threats. Zhang Dongyue played the first move correctly, but later felt uncertain and made an extra defensive move, which led to the reversal of the game situation.]GC[Type: Life & Death | Level: 6D | Rating: 4.4/5 | Correct: 28% (207/739) | Desc: Created by 5-dan Yin Hang. Commentary: I created this problem based on the shape of the letter "I" in "SPRING". It was totally beyond my expectation that this shape actually appeared in a real game - in the 2008 National Individual Weiqi Tournament, this shape emerged during the match between Cui Can and Zhang Dongyue. Cui Can had done this problem before and knew the inner group was dead, so he used the variations inside as ko threats. Zhang Dongyue played the first move correctly, but later felt uncertain and made an extra defensive move, which led to the reversal of the game situation. | First move: Black]AB[ra]AB[hb]AB[rb]AB[gc]AB[qc]AB[hd]AB[id]AB[jd]AB[kd]AB[ld]AB[md]AB[nd]AB[od]AB[pd]AB[qd]AW[ic]AW[jc]AW[kc]AW[lc]AW[mc]AW[nc]AW[oc]AW[pc](;B[ja](;W[ka](;B[ia](;W[jb];B[lb];W[mb];B[ob];W[pb];B[pa](;W[nb];B[oa];W[na];B[la]C[RIGHT])(;W[na];B[la]C[RIGHT]))(;W[lb];B[jb];W[pb];B[oa];W[pa];B[nb];W[kb];B[ma]C[RIGHT]))(;B[pa];W[oa];B[ob];W[pb];B[na];W[ma];B[oa];W[nb];B[qa];W[lb]C[WRONG]))(;W[pa];B[ka];W[la];B[mb];W[nb];B[pb]C[RIGHT]))(;B[ma](;W[la];B[pa];W[na];B[mb];W[lb];B[ja]C[RIGHT])(;W[na];B[ka];W[la];B[lb];W[ja];B[jb];W[ib];B[ia];W[kb]C[WRONG]))(;B[pa](;W[na];B[oa];W[ob];B[mb];W[lb];B[ka]C[RIGHT])(;W[nb];B[ma];W[oa];B[ka]C[RIGHT])(;W[oa](;B[ob];W[nb];B[na];W[ma];B[oa];W